{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/c0c1bb545f977dfdf8aba7fbcdfe6a44.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.mp4?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Quizard\u2019s Domain is the world\u2019s first true Battle Quiz, fusing classic, choice-based trivia game elements with exciting real-time arena combat! <br>Knowing the answer to each question will get you far, but it won\u2019t be your only skill that\u2019s put to the test. <br>Time is constantly ticking away as you run, float, jump, fly, and use all kinds of versatile abilities to fight for dominance in each unique arena. <br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/71e8068da99a99aa25c4b2e962fd4136.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.mp4?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Think you know the answer? Better book it over there before someone blocks your spot.<br>No idea what it might be? Watch opponents to predict where they\u2019re going and get there first.<br>Make use of your strengths and head straight to your goal. <br>Abuse your opponent\u2019s weaknesses to stop them in their tracks. <br>Or hide your plans and lead other players astray by repositioning at the last second. <br>You decide anew how you want to smash your way to victory in every fast-paced round!<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/278fcba5d987494c21324ad77d1a1926.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/26764d7d6875ac9458a6d74ce683f036.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/26764d7d6875ac9458a6d74ce683f036.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Whether you\u2019re here to learn, show off your knowledge of a topic, or simply dunk on the competition, you\u2019ll be able to do it in style. <br>Agility and archery, control over frightening eldritch powers, and many other skillsets let you play to your own strengths.<br>The already diverse roster of characters and worlds will keep expanding with free post-launch updates, alongside new game modes, customization options, and much more!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2802490?t=1756990317","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756990317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756990317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756990317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3032770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>NEW PLAYABLE CHARACTER!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <u><strong>Roger Ribbit</strong></u>,\u00a0a very special addition to the roster, in honor of The Frog Cult and Spelkollektivet's Froggy Sale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/a1cdf8849b46563c4bd388ae9d3ba6d7.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=384 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/a1cdf8849b46563c4bd388ae9d3ba6d7.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/a1cdf8849b46563c4bd388ae9d3ba6d7.mp4?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start playing him in the demo RIGHT NOW!<br>His high-powered frog-leg jumps and sticky grapple tongue ability will let you zip around the arena, pull in unwitting opponents, and dunk on your friends harder than ever :)</p></p><br><h1>Discord Server Open!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/9bf8ccbc0b4bb49dd4a2c13757a809bc.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Link in sidebar ---------------------------------------------------------------------&gt;&gt;</strong></p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/c0c1bb545f977dfdf8aba7fbcdfe6a44.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/2b0809a7c54c47739403e324fef78eb1.mp4?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Quizard\u2019s Domain is the world\u2019s first true Battle Quiz, fusing classic, choice-based trivia game elements with exciting real-time arena combat! <br>Knowing the answer to each question will get you far, but it won\u2019t be your only skill that\u2019s put to the test. <br>Time is constantly ticking away as you run, float, jump, fly, and use all kinds of versatile abilities to fight for dominance in each unique arena. <br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/71e8068da99a99aa25c4b2e962fd4136.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.webm?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/4731f2fb9982f59618e0b4730e0e213c.mp4?t=1756990317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Think you know the answer? Better book it over there before someone blocks your spot.<br>No idea what it might be? Watch opponents to predict where they\u2019re going and get there first.<br>Make use of your strengths and head straight to your goal. <br>Abuse your opponent\u2019s weaknesses to stop them in their tracks. <br>Or hide your plans and lead other players astray by repositioning at the last second. <br>You decide anew how you want to smash your way to victory in every fast-paced round!<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/278fcba5d987494c21324ad77d1a1926.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 height=96 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2802490/extras/26764d7d6875ac9458a6d74ce683f036.poster.avif?t=1756990317\" width=616 hei